# sweep.status (P0-a §2.3 macro) — the sweep fan: conds / branches / pending / done / failed. A
# guest-readable forward to the `sweep.status` operator. The sweep name is `sweep=` under macro.run
# (which reserves `name`); the direct op `sweep.status … name=<sweep>` is equivalent.
#
#!params bench,sweep
sweep.status bench="$bench" name="$sweep"
